<title>TURKEY: Turkish c.bank buys lira for dlrs - bankers.</title>
<headline>Turkish c.bank buys lira for dlrs - bankers.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank bought lira for dollars just before the currency market closed on Friday to curb dollar demand buoyed by rising political tension and excess liquidity, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said banks' lira bids firmed to 140,350 against the dollar after the central bank intervention from previous 140,420. more eks</p>
